{
  "id": 1031,
  "name": "polished-mud-ball",
  "fling_power": 30,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "loot",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/24/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "じかんを　かけて　みがきあげた\nひょうめんが　ツルツルに　ひかる\nどろで　できた　だんご。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "시간을 들여 빚어낸\n표면이 반질반질하게 빛나는\n진흙으로 만든 경단.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "花了不少時間\n把表面磨得\n非常光滑的泥球。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une boulette de boue si bien polie qu’elle brille\nde mille feux.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Kugel aus Schlamm, die so lange Zeit poliert\nwurde, dass ihre Oberfläche nun leuchtend glänzt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bola de barro que ha sido pulida durante tanto tiempo\nque su superficie ha quedado lisa y brillante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una pallina di fango levigata con cura, tanto che\nla sua superficie è liscia e lucida.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A ball made of mud. It had been polished for such\na long time that the surface is very shiny.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "時間を　かけて　磨きあげた\n表面が　ツルツルに　光る\n泥で　できた　団子。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用泥土制作的丸子。\n花了大把时间打磨，\n表面油光水滑。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
